# The no-picture state of the picture routes and their authorization; each session deletes its own picture first (200 even
# when none exists). Uploads and ETag/304: profile-picture-upload-check.py; the stream: profile-picture-updates-check.py.

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@AdminEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_EMAIL}}
@AdminPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
@NonAdminEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_MECHANIC_EMAIL}}
@NonAdminPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_MECHANIC_PASSWORD}}
@NonExistentPersonId = 99999

### [Setup][Profile] Clear any session cookie left by a previous file (204 or 401, not asserted)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Setup][Profile] Login as admin first, capture the admin's own person id
# @name adminPictureLogin
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][Profile] Logout admin before the non-admin mechanic session (204 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204

###

### [Setup][Profile] Login as the plain mechanic, capture their own person id
# @name nonAdminPictureLogin
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{NonAdminEmail}}", "password": "{{NonAdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Profile] Delete the own picture, which answers 200 whether or not one exists (200 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/picture
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 200
?? js (response.parsedBody.message === "Profile picture removed.") == true

###

### [Positive][Profile] The profile reports no picture (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.hasProfilePicture == false

###

### [Negative][Profile] Get own picture while none is stored (404 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/picture

?? status == 404

###

### [Negative][Profile] A conditional get of a missing picture is still 404, never 304 (404 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/picture
If-None-Match: "no-picture-uploaded-by-this-file"

?? status == 404

###

### [Negative][Profile] Get own picture through the id route while none is stored (404 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/picture/{{nonAdminPictureLogin.personId}}

?? status == 404

###

### [Negative][Profile] A plain mechanic cannot get the admin's picture by person id (403 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/picture/{{adminPictureLogin.personId}}

?? status == 403

###

### [Negative][Profile] The id route answers 403 for a plain mechanic even for an id that does not exist (403 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/picture/{{NonExistentPersonId}}

?? status == 403

###

### [Positive][Profile] Deleting again is idempotent (200 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/picture
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][Profile] Logout the plain mechanic before the admin picture checks (204 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204

###

### [Setup][Profile] Login as admin for the person-id picture checks
# @name Login
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Profile] Delete the admin's own picture, so the checks below start without one (200 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/picture
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 200
?? js (response.parsedBody.message === "Profile picture removed.") == true

###

### [Negative][Profile] The admin may ask for a mechanic's picture by id, which has none (404 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/picture/{{nonAdminPictureLogin.personId}}

?? status == 404

###

### [Negative][Profile] A conditional admin get of a mechanic without a picture is 404, never 304 (404 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/picture/{{nonAdminPictureLogin.personId}}
If-None-Match: "no-picture-uploaded-by-this-file"

?? status == 404

###

### [Negative][Profile] The admin gets 404 for a person id that does not exist (404 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/picture/{{NonExistentPersonId}}

?? status == 404

###

### [Negative][Profile] The admin's own picture is missing too (404 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/picture

?? status == 404

###

### [Setup][Profile] Logout before the unauthenticated picture checks (204 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204

###

### [Negative][Profile] Unauthenticated get profile picture (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/picture

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Profile] Unauthenticated get profile picture by person id (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
# Any integer id works: the group's RequireAuthorization answers 401 before the handler loads the person.
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/picture/999999

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Profile] Unauthenticated delete profile picture (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/picture
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Profile] Unauthenticated picture upload (401 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
PUT {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/profile/picture
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

?? status == 401
